{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/wedyan-the-canal-al-ghurair-development-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1446,"crm_id":"7882","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Wedyan The Canal","slug":"wedyan-the-canal-al-ghurair-development-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","sky-villa"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Al Ghurair Development","price":24100000,"display_price":"24.1M","lattitude":25.183313262375,"longitude":55.262866562512,"min_bedrooms":3,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Wedyan - The Canal in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/business-bay/\">Business Bay</a> is an upcoming project located along the prestigious Dubai Water Canal. This iconic project consists of two towers spanning 40 floors, with a total of 149 luxury units including <strong>3, 4 and 5-bedroom apartments,</strong> <strong>as well as exclusive penthouses and a sky villa</strong>. Designed to offer high capital appreciation, Wedyan combines architectural elegance with the tranquil charm of the waterfront location, offering residents an exceptional living experience. The units can be booked with a 10% down payment.</p><p>Wedyan by Al Ghurair Development is a bold addition to the city’s skyline, shaped by the award-winning architect Kengo Kuma. The design emphasizes harmony with nature, blending seamlessly with its surroundings. It offers a wide range of world-class amenities, including swimming pools, a state-of-the-art gym, a clubhouse, a cinema enclave, and a kids’ club. This luxurious development is the first in the Al Ghurair Collection, marking the beginning of an exciting chapter in Dubai's real estate landscape.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2